 Herbert with Claude (Anthropic) and GPT (OpenAI), as Rule 30 Prize submission [PORTAL-ID](https://www.wolframcloud.com/obj/rule-30-prize/Agents/status/PORTAL-ID). | `no_recognizable_ranking`, `no_recognizable_ranking_nat`, `no_wall_recognizable_ranking`, `no_windowed_recognizable_ranking`, `no_local_ranking_of_recognizable`, `edge_decomp`, `sharp_rows_check`, `sharp_rows_width`, `sharp_rows_survive`, `sharp_rows_fourteen`, `no_width_bounded_ranking`, `no_edge_automaton_ranking`, `no_joint_recognizable_ranking`, `no_joint_recognizable_ranking_nat`, `no_joint_windowed_recognizable_ranking`, `no_joint_local_ranking_of_recognizable`, `c7cut_span` |
